#. module: sale_subscription_loyalty
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_subscription_loyalty
msgid ""
"\n"
"This module adds loyalty features to the subscription system, by:\n"
"Offering subscriptions with X free sessions or products each month.\n"
"Automatically adding loyalty points to the customer's loyalty card at each "
"renewal.\n"
"Applying discount on the first X months of the subscription.\n"
"Automatically applying available rewards at each renewal (if loyalty points "
"are available).\n"
"Defining if loyalty rules grant points on each subscription renewal.\n"
"Defining if rewards can be applied at each renewal (if there are still "
"enough points).\n"
msgstr ""

